'''Soaring Pokémon Kids''' (Japanese: '''そらとぶポケモンキッズ''' '' Soratobu Pokémon Kids'') is one of the ending songs of the Japanese [[Pikachu short]]s; debuting in ''[[PK04|Pikachu Expedition]]'' and later used as the ending theme of ''[[PK13|Pikachu's Summer Festival]]''.

